Design
  The model lifecycle (load on demand, keep-alive, runner subprocesses) follows
  the design of Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, MIT). The HTTP API
  follows OpenAI's audio and realtime APIs. No code from either is included.

Each model's own license is recorded in its manifest and shown by
`oaudio show <model>`. Model files are downloaded from their publishers at run
time and are not part of this repository.
